{'symbol': 'TAP', 'date': '2021-10-06 06:00:00', 'title': 'TRUSS CBD USA, A MOLSON COORS AND HEXO CORP JOINT VENTURE, EXPANDS VERYVELL™ CBD BEVERAGES SEMI-NATIONALLY', 'text': 'DENVER, OCT. 6, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- TRUSS CBD USA, A JOINT VENTURE BY MOLSON COORS BEVERAGE COMPANY (NYSE: TAP) AND HEXO USA INC, A SUBSIDIARY OF HEXO CORP (NASDAQ: HEXO),\xa0TODAY ANNOUNCES THE EXPANSION OF\xa0VERYVELL, A\xa0LINE OF\xa0HEMP-DERIVED CBD AND ADAPTOGEN BEVERAGES. FOLLOWING A SUCCESSFUL COLORADO LAUNCH IN 2020, TRUSS CBD USA NOW EXPANDS VERYVELL SEMI-NATIONALLY TO BE AVAILABLE IN 17 STATES.'}